{
  "bookId": "hero-213016",
  "id": "bond-27548",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "27548001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克莱儿",
          "text": "嗯！这次配合得很棒~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27548002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克莱儿",
          "text": "大家先休息一下，一会儿我们再来一遍~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27548003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "克莱儿？我刚刚接到社区发来的……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27548004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text": "滴——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27548005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "停电通知……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27548006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克莱儿",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27548007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "克莱儿？你还好吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27548008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "你怕黑吗？我这里有备用手电，现在就打开。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27548009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克莱儿",
          "text": "我不怕黑，我就是……讨厌停电。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27548010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克莱儿",
          "text": "一旦停电的话，原定的排练计划就泡汤了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27548011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "没关系，正好可以趁这个机会休息一下，你看——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27548012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "在光污染日渐严重的城市中，也只有在大规模停电的时候，我们才能看到这么多的星星。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27548013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克莱儿",
          "text": "好漂亮！这么多星星……等等，那个是！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27548014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "流星！克莱儿快许愿！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27548015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克莱儿",
          "text": "希望接下来不会再停电……\n或者，下次停电的时候，你也在我身边。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
